{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 05 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">自监督学习：对比、聚类、自蒸馏与遮挡重建</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Self-Supervised Learning</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_028_ibot-title\">iBOT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">EMA teacher 同时充当在线视觉 tokenizer，以图像级 DINO 蒸馏和被遮 patch token 蒸馏联合训练。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Uses the EMA teacher simultaneously as an online visual tokenizer to jointly distill masked patch tokens alongside global [CLS] self-distillation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同一图像的多裁剪视图与随机遮蔽 patch</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Multi-crop augmented views with random block-wise patch masking applied to the student</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">同时具备全局语义和局部 patch 语义的视觉表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">ViT representations capturing both global image semantics and fine-grained local patch semantics</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=ydopy-e6Dg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_028_ibot')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_028_ibot')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"iBOT original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/e6b1cc75e414f88e27b9.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_028_ibot\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_028_ibot')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_028_ibot\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Crops + Patch Mask</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Crops + Patch Mask</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">student 视图随机遮蔽部分 patch；teacher 观察对应未遮蔽全局视图。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-crop augmented views with random block-wise patch masking applied to the student and prepares initial tensor representations (Crops + Patch Mask).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"student 视图随机遮蔽部分 patch；teacher 观察对应未遮蔽全局视图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests multi-crop augmented views with random block-wise patch masking applied to the student and prepares initial tensor representations (Crops + Patch Mask).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Crops + Patch Mask\" data-node-name-en=\"Crops + Patch Mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Crops + Patch Mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">student 视图随机遮蔽部分 patch；teacher 观察对应未遮蔽全局视图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests multi-crop augmented views with random block-wise patch masking applied to the student and prepares initial tensor representations (Crops + Patch Mask).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出 CLS token 与所有 patch token，接收梯度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Student ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Student ViT\" data-node-name-en=\"Student ViT\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Student ViT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出 CLS token 与所有 patch token，接收梯度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Student ViT to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同构 teacher 在完整图像上产生在线目标，参数由 EMA 更新。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs EMA Teacher within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"EMA Teacher\" data-node-name-en=\"EMA Teacher\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>EMA Teacher</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同构 teacher 在完整图像上产生在线目标，参数由 EMA 更新。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs EMA Teacher within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"student 与 teacher 的 CLS 概率用于跨视图图像级自蒸馏。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CLS Heads within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"CLS Heads\" data-node-name-en=\"CLS Heads\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>CLS Heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">student 与 teacher 的 CLS 概率用于跨视图图像级自蒸馏。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CLS Heads within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"teacher patch 输出作为在线视觉 token；student 对被遮位置预测这些分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Patch Heads within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Patch Heads\" data-node-name-en=\"Patch Heads\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Patch Heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">teacher patch 输出作为在线视觉 token；student 对被遮位置预测这些分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Patch Heads within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"不同 crops 的 CLS 概率交叉熵继承 DINO 的图像级不变性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs global distillation within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"全局蒸馏\" data-node-name-en=\"global distillation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局蒸馏</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global distillation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">不同 crops 的 CLS 概率交叉熵继承 DINO 的图像级不变性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs global distillation within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"只在 student 被遮蔽位置匹配 teacher 对应 patch 分布。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Masked Patch distillation within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Masked Patch 蒸馏\" data-node-name-en=\"Masked Patch distillation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Masked Patch 蒸馏</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Masked Patch distillation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">只在 student 被遮蔽位置匹配 teacher 对应 patch 分布。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Masked Patch distillation within the core online tokenizer image patch distillation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像级与 patch 级自蒸馏共同更新 student。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies objective to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"联合目标\" data-node-name-en=\"objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">联合目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像级与 patch 级自蒸馏共同更新 student。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies objective to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CLS 服务分类，patch tokens 服务检测、分割和对应关系。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces vit representations capturing both global image semantics and fine-grained local patch semantics via global + feature.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"全局 + 稠密特征\" data-node-name-en=\"global + feature\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_028_ibot', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">全局 + 稠密特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">global + feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CLS 服务分类，patch tokens 服务检测、分割和对应关系。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces vit representations capturing both global image semantics and fine-grained local patch semantics via global + feature.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"iBOT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 图像级蒸馏叠加被遮 patch token 蒸馏</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Joint Global [CLS] Self-Distillation &amp; Online Masked Patch Token Distillation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"iBOT：核心公式 · 图像级蒸馏叠加被遮 patch token 蒸馏\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"28\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"25.655756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -68.996029 172.062896 25.655756\" width=\"172.062896pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.506851-.057964V-.420242H2.130194C1.478094-.420242 .840485-.956414 .753538-1.68097H3.383676V-2.043248H.753538C.833239-2.731576 1.405639-3.303975 2.130194-3.303975H3.506851V-3.666253H2.159177C1.152044-3.666253 .376769-2.825768 .376769-1.862109S1.152044-.057964 2.159177-.057964H3.506851Z\" id=\"m028_g7-50\"></path><path d=\"M5.376205-.485452L5.339977-.557908C5.028418-.217367 4.571948 0 4.108232 0C3.318466 0 2.557682-.239103 1.804144-.434734C2.59391-1.137553 3.043135-1.934564 3.217028-2.977925C3.303975-3.521342 3.383676-4.753087 4.14446-4.753087C4.463265-4.753087 4.738596-4.637158 4.738596-4.27488C4.738596-4.129969 4.66614-3.992303 4.564702-3.890865V-3.811164C4.738596-3.869129 5.30375-4.129969 5.30375-4.34009C5.30375-4.803806 4.702368-4.99219 4.325599-4.99219C2.347561-4.99219 2.470736-2.941697 2.086721-1.557795C2.021511-1.311446 1.68097-.543417 1.383902-.543417C1.181026-.543417 .985396-.623118 .78252-.623118C.514435-.623118 .152157-.094192 .050719 .123175L.086947 .173893C.210121 .072456 .39126-.043473 .557908-.043473C1.782408-.043473 2.905469 .623118 4.129969 .623118C4.869016 .623118 5.158838 .144911 5.376205-.485452Z\" id=\"m028_g7-76\"></path><path d=\"M7.774485-.384015C7.738258-.347787 7.687539-.32605 7.63682-.32605C7.209332-.32605 7.209332-1.507076 7.209332-1.804144C7.209332-2.753313 7.260051-4.14446 7.673047