ref=\"#m028_g13-56\" y=\"-59.656309\"></use><use x=\"83.794725\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g13-66\" y=\"-53.080991\"></use><use x=\"88.270975\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g10-185\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"93.190014\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g23-126\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"91.987036\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g16-71\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"96.893609\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g10-186\" y=\"-55.541749\"></use><use x=\"100.908542\" xlink:href=\"#m028_g4-1\" y=\"-63.135754\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">BEiT 依赖离线离散 tokenizer，局部与全局目标割裂</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">BEiT required a separately pretrained offline discrete VAE tokenizer, decoupling local token recovery from global semantic learning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用 EMA teacher 作为在线 tokenizer，同时蒸馏 masked patch 和全局 class token</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Turn the EMA teacher network itself into an online continuous/categorical tokenizer supervising masked student patch tokens.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">联合在线 tokenization、patch-level MIM 与 image-level self-distillation</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Unifies DINO-style global self-distillation with masked image modeling (MIM) in a single single-stage online teacher–student loop.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为病理 Phikon、TITAN 等医学 foundation 配方的重要来源</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core pretraining ingredient in DINOv2, Phikon, UNI, Virchow, and TITAN pathology foundation models.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">重要训练思想；常与 DINO 系目标组合使用</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Highly effective dense + global SSL objective; standardly deployed in tandem with DINOv2 recipes.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把 teacher 自身的 patch 分布当作在线 tokenizer，避免依赖离线聚类或固定视觉词表。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">masked image modeling 不直接回归像素，而是预测 teacher 的语义 token，提升局部表征的抽象层级。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">CLS 跨视图目标与 patch 遮蔽目标分别约束全局不变性和局部可辨性。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Turn the EMA teacher network itself into an online continuous/categorical tokenizer supervising masked student patch tokens.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Unifies DINO-style global self-distillation with masked image modeling (MIM) in a single single-stage online teacher–student loop.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Joint Global [CLS] Self-Distillation &amp; Online Masked Patch Token Distillation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">patch 级语义目标更契合病灶分割和组织检索，但位置对应要求增强几何变换可精确追踪。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">teacher 可能把数据偏差固化为伪标签，跨机构或跨染色验证仍不可省略。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Core pretraining ingredient in DINOv2, Phikon, UNI, Virchow, and TITAN pathology foundation models.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Highly effective dense + global SSL objective; standardly deployed in tandem with DINOv2 recipes.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ydopy-e6Dg\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>iBOT: Image BERT Pre-Training with Online Tokenizer</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bytedance/ibot\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
